@startuml TestMonitoringSystem_SequenceDiagram

title Real-time Test Monitoring Dashboard - Test Result Processing Flow

actor "Test Execution Engine" as TestEngine
participant "TestMonitoringDashboard" as Dashboard
participant "RealTimeDataService" as RealTimeService
participant "MetricsCalculator" as Calculator
participant "AlertingService" as AlertService
participant "DashboardSubscriber" as Subscriber
participant "AlertListener" as AlertListener

== Test Result Publishing ==

TestEngine -> Dashboard: publishTestResult(testResult)
activate Dashboard

Dashboard -> RealTimeService: publishTestResult(testResult)
activate RealTimeService

RealTimeService -> RealTimeService: Store test result in\nconcurrent map by projectId
note right: Thread-safe storage using\nConcurrentHashMap

RealTimeService -> Calculator: calculateMetrics(testResults)
activate Calculator

Calculator -> Calculator: Calculate total tests,\npass rate, failure rate
Calculator -> Calculator: Calculate average execution time
Calculator -> Calculator: Calculate test velocity\n(tests per hour)
Calculator -> Calculator: Identify top failures
Calculator -> Calculator: Calculate environment metrics

Calculator --> RealTimeService: DashboardMetrics
deactivate Calculator

RealTimeService -> RealTimeService: Create DashboardUpdate\nwith test result and metrics

== Real-time Notification ==

RealTimeService -> Subscriber: onDashboardUpdate(update)
activate Subscriber
note right: Parallel notification\nto all subscribers
Subscriber -> Subscriber: Update dashboard UI\nin real-time
deactivate Subscriber

== Alert Evaluation ==

RealTimeService -> Dashboard: Notify about new test result
Dashboard -> AlertService: evaluateAlerts(testResult, metrics)
activate AlertService

AlertService -> AlertService: Get alert rules\nfor project
loop For each enabled alert rule
    AlertService -> AlertService: evaluateRule(rule, testResult, metrics)
    
    alt Rule condition met
        AlertService -> AlertService: triggerAlert(rule, testResult, metrics)
        AlertService -> AlertService: Generate alert message
        AlertService -> AlertListener: onAlert(alert)
        activate AlertListener
        AlertListener -> AlertListener: Send notification\n(email, Slack, etc.)
        deactivate AlertListener
    end
end

deactivate AlertService
deactivate RealTimeService
deactivate Dashboard

== Dashboard Query ==

actor "Dashboard User" as User
User -> Dashboard: getCurrentMetrics(projectId)
activate Dashboard

Dashboard -> RealTimeService: getCurrentMetrics(projectId)
activate RealTimeService

RealTimeService -> RealTimeService: Get stored test results\nfor project
RealTimeService -> Calculator: calculateMetrics(testResults)
activate Calculator

Calculator --> RealTimeService: DashboardMetrics
deactivate Calculator

RealTimeService --> Dashboard: DashboardMetrics
deactivate RealTimeService

Dashboard --> User: Current metrics and statistics
deactivate Dashboard

== Concurrent Test Processing ==

note over TestEngine, AlertListener: Multiple test engines can publish results concurrently

par Concurrent Test Execution
    TestEngine -> Dashboard: publishTestResult(testResult1)
else
    TestEngine -> Dashboard: publishTestResult(testResult2)
else
    TestEngine -> Dashboard: publishTestResult(testResult3)
end

note over RealTimeService: Thread-safe processing ensures\ndata consistency and real-time updates

@enduml
